{"id":"gespra_ch","lemma":"Gespräch","pos":"noun","rank":1043,"glosses":["conversation, chat, talk (conversing between people or parties, either for pleasure or for business)"],"ipa":"/ɡəˈʃpʁɛːç/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f5/De-Gespr%C3%A4ch.ogg/De-Gespr%C3%A4ch.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"Gespräches","plural":"Gespräche"},"examples":[{"text":"Warum führen wir dieses Gespräch?","en":"Why are we having this conversation?","words":[{"g":"why"},{"g":"to lead"},{"g":"we"},{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},null]},{"text":"Wir hatten ein gutes Gespräch.","en":"We had a good conversation.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"good","l":"gut"},null]},{"text":"Sie kamen sofort ins Gespräch.","en":"They fell into the conversation immediately.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to come","l":"kommen"},{"g":"immediately, at once"},{"g":"into the"},null]},{"text":"Die Gespräche müssten bald beginnen.","en":"The talks should begin soon.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to have to","l":"müssen"},{"g":"soon"},{"g":"to begin"}]},{"text":"Ich habe unser Gespräch aufgenommen.","en":"I recorded our conversation.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"our"},null,{"g":"recorded"}]}]}